# recursive interpolation not allowed

Huapuka kākau: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Polokalamu hiʻona: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), laina-hou.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Huapuka kākau: a, laina-hou.


Polokalamu hiʻona: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] hoʻā: ʻOiaʻiʻo.

